WEBVTT

40:33.047 --> 40:35.715
Patient is... prepped.

40:36.550 --> 40:41.304
No one's ever attempted a double
bypass brain transplant before.

40:42.389 --> 40:45.141
Now for the tricky part.
Pliers!

40:45.226 --> 40:48.019
I don't believe that man's
ever been to medical school.

40:49.980 --> 40:52.649
Doctor, you've done it!

40:53.901 --> 40:55.318
Hannah!

40:55.986 --> 40:57.403
Janie's all better now.

40:58.572 --> 41:02.117
-Mom! Mom!
-She's lying!
